{{also|BrE|BRE}}
==Albanian==

===Etymology===
Probably a short form of {{etyl|ine-pro|sq}} {{m|ine-pro|*bhrā́ter-||brother}}. Compare Illyrian {{l|sq|bra||brother}}, {{cog|cu|bratъ}}, Old Prussian {{m|prg|brāti}}, Old Norse {{m|non|broðir||brother}}.

===Interjection===
{{head|sq|interjection}}

# A friendly [[exclamation]] to a [[person]].
#: Folni '''''bre''', burra!
#:: Speak, '''''therefore''', men!
# An [[exclamation]] of [[surprise]].
#: '''''Bre'''! Po ç'është kjo?
#:: '''''Man'''! What is this?

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|sq|brez}}
* {{l|sq|pra}}

